{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Tyr, an 8v8 vehicle shooter where strategic teamwork and mastery of unique vehicle powers reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>-------------------------------------------</strong><br><br><strong>===\ud83e\udea7 We're looking for playtesters. Sign up at \ud83d\udc49 stoke.firstlook.gg. \ud83e\udea7===</strong><br><br><strong>-------------------------------------------</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyr features a roster of specialized armored vehicles and pilots. You\u2019ll take control of treaded and hover tanks alike as you rumble and glide across the battlefield.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle features a unique power that impacts Tyr\u2019s moment-to-moment play on the battlefield. A tank may have the ability to blink several vehicle lengths forward or back, send out a sonar pulse to spot enemies, or overcharge its engine to ram directly into an opponent and deal massive damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle also offers its own tech tree and ammo &amp; component slots, affording you the ability to upgrade and evolve your ride to suit your playstyle. You may even be able to change up your vehicle\u2019s unique keystone tech to dynamically alter your personal meta.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tyr, you and your opponents will only be visible when within range or while making enough noise. Deciding when to push forward and when to fire from cover could mean the difference between staying hidden and revealing your position to the entire enemy team, so play carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyr will test your mental mettle, patience, and teamwork, as deliberate play beats whoever can fire the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2445260?t=1762790376","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/30d0bf04fb32f83efd9ec4025eed9ebbf2d7654d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762790376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/4bd51a19beb3bdde0c4900439eb4d64e547e9579/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762790376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/4bd51a19beb3bdde0c4900439eb4d64e547e9579/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762790376","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>PRIVATE PLAYTEST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/0934ae3a9b7cb9a2aa4eaa18aa10356a.avif?t=1762790376\" width=780 height=240 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Tyr, an 8v8 vehicle shooter where strategic teamwork and mastery of unique vehicle powers reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>-------------------------------------------</strong><br><br><strong>===\ud83e\udea7 We're looking for playtesters. Sign up at \ud83d\udc49 stoke.firstlook.gg. \ud83e\udea7===</strong><br><br><strong>-------------------------------------------</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyr features a roster of specialized armored vehicles and pilots. You\u2019ll take control of treaded and hover tanks alike as you rumble and glide across the battlefield.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle features a unique power that impacts Tyr\u2019s moment-to-moment play on the battlefield. A tank may have the ability to blink several vehicle lengths forward or back, send out a sonar pulse to spot enemies, or overcharge its engine to ram directly into an opponent and deal massive damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle also offers its own tech tree and ammo &amp; component slots, affording you the ability to upgrade and evolve your ride to suit your playstyle. You may even be able to change up your vehicle\u2019s unique keystone tech to dynamically alter your personal meta.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tyr, you and your opponents will only be visible when within range or while making enough noise. Deciding when to push forward and when to fire from cover could mean the difference between staying hidden and revealing your position to the entire enemy team, so play carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.poster.avif?t=1762790376\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.webm?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.mp4?t=1762790376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyr will test your mental mettle, patience, and teamwork, as deliberate play beats whoever can fire the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Stoke Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/597667b77e6465ece1dcc5affd0f94e5dc489491/header.jpg?t=1762790376","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Stoke Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2445260/1456367